SUMMARY:Good Laughs Comedy Show
DESCRIPTION:Good Laughs is back this year at Danforth Comedy Bar with another stellar line-up\, including Chris Blom\, Michael Currie\, Alan Kenigsberg\, Christine Kilby\, Joshua Lerner\, and Joshua Ng. We’re thrilled to have Martha Chaves as our Emcee for the evening. Martha is an award winning stand-up comedian\, actor and comedy writer\, often heard on CBC Radio’s The Debaters and Laugh Out Loud. Daryl Jung from Now Magazine called her “Witty\, sassy\, provocative\, and very funny.” We invite you to join us for an evening of laughs for a good cause\, in support of Michael Garron Hospital. Purchase tickets at www.goodlaughs.ca for either the 7 PM or the 9 PM show.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/good-laughs-comedy-show/
LOCATION:Comedy Bar Danforth\, 2800 Danforth\, Toronto\, M4C1M1
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/01142418/GoodLaughs.ca_.jpg
END:VEVENT
