SUMMARY:East End Kids Pride Day\, 2026!
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join East End Community Members\, East End Arts\, and Shadowland Theatre for the fourth annual East End Kids Pride\, 2026! This will be an opportunity to come together with rainbow families\, friends\, neighbours\, and the east end queer community to celebrate #EastEndLove and queer joy! This year’s program theme is “Fantastical Fairies and Fauna”. Please join us for our magical Parade & Celebration Day on Sunday May 31st in Dentonia Park! The Parade Day will feature a community pride parade\, performances\, face-painting\, dancing\, snacks\, art stations\, a Queer Arts market\, and so much more!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/east-end-kids-pride-day-2026/
LOCATION:Dentonia Park\, 80 Thyra Ave\, Toronto\, M4C 5G3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24173734/Kidspride2026-SQUARE.png
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
