SUMMARY:Courtyard Farmers' Market
DESCRIPTION:The Courtyard Farmers’ Markets\, (courtyardfarmersmkt.ca)\, celebrates our third season at Robertson Parkette\, 1549 Danforth Ave\, Toronto\, ON\, M4J 1N8!🍎 Join us Wednesdays afternoons\,\nJune 3\, 2026 – October 7\, 2026\, 3:30 pm – 7:30 pm ET\nRobertson Parkette\n1549 Danforth Avenue at Coxwell Avenue! Thank you! Continued blessings!
